sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Handler as "Axum handler<br/>api_allocations"
    participant Alloc as "AllocationsService"
    participant Provider as "CryptoProvider port<br/>(ReqwestCryptoProvider)"
    participant CMC as "CoinMarketCap API"
    participant Store as "AllocationStore port<br/>(FileCsvStore)"
    participant Repo as "HistoryRepo port<br/>(SqliteRepo)"
    participant DB as "SQLite"
    participant Compute as "compute_allocations<br/>(pure function)"
    participant History as "HistoryService"

    Note over Client,Handler: CurrentUser extractor verifies the access_token<br/>cookie first — see docs/sequence-login.mmd.<br/>Any authenticated role may call this endpoint.

    Client->>Handler: GET /api/allocations (Cookie: access_token=...)
    Handler->>Alloc: compute_and_record(api_key, market)

    Alloc->>Provider: fetch_latest(api_key)
    Provider->>CMC: GET /cryptocurrency/listings/latest
    CMC-->>Provider: price data (wire format)
    Provider-->>Alloc: Vec<Crypto> (domain type)

    Alloc->>Store: read_barca_allocations(path, market)
    Store-->>Alloc: HashMap<group, target_percent>

    Alloc->>Repo: fetch_current_wallet_allocations()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM wallet_allocations_current
    DB-->>Repo: rows
    Repo-->>Alloc: Vec<WalletAllocation>

    Alloc->>Compute: compute_allocations(allocations, cryptos, targets)
    Compute-->>Alloc: per_asset / per_group / per_barca (JSON)

    Alloc->>Repo: persist_allocation_record(record)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO allocations
    Alloc-->>Handler: allocations JSON

    Handler->>History: persist_snapshots(ts, per_asset, per_group, per_barca, total_value)
    History->>Repo: insert_asset_snapshot / insert_group_snapshot / insert_barca_snapshot / insert_total_snapshot
    Repo->>DB: INSERT OR IGNORE ...

    Handler-->>Client: 200 OK (allocations JSON)

    Note over Handler,Repo: Every hop logs structured tracing events<br/>(error!/warn!/info! with symbol, error, counts)<br/>so a failure is traceable from logs alone.
